    <detaileddescription>
<para>Attribute corresponding to a metric.</para><para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> metric attribute represents a numeric value obtained by either dynamic analysis (gprof or hpct) or static analysis (for example number of flop operations in a function) It <ref refid="classMetricAttribute" kindref="compound">MetricAttribute</ref> can be a raw (observed), or a propagated (derived) count It containes no name-string, because the attribute is stored in an AttributeMechanism-map, where the name is the key. </para>    </detaileddescription>
